OL,3,GNEWSASilence of the Lambs moth found in
OL,4,Aschool compost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant moth made famous by the film
OL,7,Fposter for Silence of the Lambs has
OL,8,Fbeen found in a school compost bin.
OL,10,FThe African death's-head hawkmoth was
OL,11,Fdiscovered in a nature area at Wicor
OL,12,FPrimary School in Portchester,
OL,13,FHampshire.
OL,15,FNative to southern Europe and Africa,
OL,16,Fthe moth has a wingspan of up to 14cm
OL,17,Fand a distinctive skull-like marking on
OL,18,Fthe back of its head.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
