OL,3,GNEWSASilence of the Lambs moth found in
OL,4,Aschool compost
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe species is rarely seen in the UK
OL,7,Fand the school's horticulturalist
OL,8,FLouise Moreton said it was a
OL,9,F"once-in-a-lifetime" chance for the
OL,10,Fchildren and staff to see it.
